WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.404 --> 00:00:04.520
Unit twenty-four. Disability and Inclusion!

2
00:00:05.496 --> 00:00:10.198
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:10.248 --> 00:00:13.875
Hi, Doctor Sokha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.925 --> 00:00:18.665
Today we learn about Disability and Inclusion. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.626 --> 00:00:23.659
Disability. Say it with me. Disability!

6
00:00:27.104 --> 00:00:31.121
Inclusion. Say it with me. Inclusion!

7
00:00:34.628 --> 00:00:39.245
Accessibility. Say it with me. Accessibility!

8
00:00:42.781 --> 00:00:46.564
Rights. Say it with me. Rights!

9
00:00:50.062 --> 00:00:53.896
Stigma. Say it with me. Stigma!

10
00:00:57.423 --> 00:01:02.590
Assistive technology. Say it with me. Assistive technology!

11
00:01:06.055 --> 00:01:09.571
Respect. Say it with me. Respect!

12
00:01:13.050 --> 00:01:17.316
Participation. Say it with me. Participation!

13
00:01:20.850 --> 00:01:32.737
Inclusion means people with a disability have equal rights and participation. Accessibility, assistive technology, and respect reduce stigma and barriers.

14
00:01:32.787 --> 00:01:36.467
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:37.174 --> 00:01:42.285
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:42.335 --> 00:01:43.712
Accessibility!

17
00:01:44.987 --> 00:01:50.187
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:50.237 --> 00:01:51.387
Respect!

19
00:01:52.345 --> 00:01:57.969
Did you know? More than 1 billion people worldwide live with some form of disability!

20
00:01:58.019 --> 00:02:00.215
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:01.362 --> 00:02:09.491
Think and answer. How can your school be more inclusive?

22
00:02:09.541 --> 00:02:10.711
Great answer!

23
00:02:11.855 --> 00:02:17.957
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:18.007 --> 00:02:20.866
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

